            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Based on the sensibel innervation of the external and middle ear, the causes and therapy of otalgia are discussed. As a result, the classical definition of otalgia: &quot;pain in the auricular area without concomitant ear pathology&quot; should be maintained.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
